1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Dreaded by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his trials, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:48,000
So, you finally made it here. Once you do, you've got the nerve to attack our guys. I'm gonna need an explanation for that.

5
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Yami was under attack by two elves who had possessed the bodies of Marks and Owen.

6
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Memory magic! Torment's Canceller attack!

7
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,000
He just managed to fend them off.

8
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,000
What? Red roses.

9
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:21,000
When a mysterious and powerful elf resembling Charlotte Roselay appeared on the sea.

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,000
I don't know you at all. You seem capable for a human.

11
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:46,000
I don't know you.

12
00:01:46,000 --> 00:02:15,980
Thank you.

13
00:02:16,540 --> 00:02:22,620
だから待って待って待って待って置いてかないでてよ

14
00:02:22,620 --> 00:02:28,240
今すぐfly away戦うtry again

15
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:34,960
だから待って待って待って同じ場所にいたいよ

16
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:43,220
霞が痛い胸の痛みが君に話したい僕の気持ちが本当のことね

17
00:02:43,220 --> 00:02:49,940
there

18
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:52,720
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

19
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:56,040
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

20
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:58,480
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

21
00:02:58,480 --> 00:02:59,620
There.

22
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:12,220
It should be safe now.

23
00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:13,540
That black bull.

24
00:03:13,540 --> 00:03:15,920
He acted like it was important.

25
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,700
What did he say was inside?

26
00:03:17,700 --> 00:03:22,700
Dark magic.

27
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:24,700
Dark cloak dimension.

28
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:25,700
Flash.

29
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:26,700
Crimson guy.

30
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:27,700
Fear.

31
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:30,700
Oh, no.

32
00:03:30,700 --> 00:03:35,700
Oh, no.

33
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:51,700
We cast our spells at the same time.

34
00:03:51,700 --> 00:03:54,700
Mine was clearly the more devastating one.

35
00:03:54,700 --> 00:04:01,700
Yet his attack split it in two, which slowed down its momentum and prevented the town from being completely decimated by the impact.

36
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:06,700
Even if it just hit my gauntlet, his spell had enough force left to reach me.

37
00:04:06,700 --> 00:04:11,700
Despite the difference in our might, he was able to turn the tide of battle in his favor.

38
00:04:11,700 --> 00:04:15,700
How could a lowly human have achieved this level of mastery?

39
00:04:15,700 --> 00:04:20,700
Though I suppose he must be exceptional if he beat those two.

40
00:04:20,700 --> 00:04:24,700
It seems I underestimated humankind.

41
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:28,700
I used more magic than planned, so I'll retreat.

42
00:04:28,700 --> 00:04:33,700
It's best to wait for Licht and the others to arrive so that I can ensure their safety.

43
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:34,700
Char!

44
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:36,700
What about the captain of the Black Bulls?

45
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:37,700
What the?

46
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:38,700
No!

47
00:04:38,700 --> 00:04:39,700
Did Char crush him?

48
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:40,700
She wouldn't.

49
00:04:40,700 --> 00:04:43,700
Don't run away from me, woman!

50
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:46,700
I still got a bone to pick with you, you hear?

51
00:04:46,700 --> 00:05:01,700
I could've died from a stunt like that!

52
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:03,700
Where is she?

53
00:05:03,700 --> 00:05:04,700
You're alive!

54
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:05,700
I mean, whatever.

55
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:06,700
I guess that's a good thing.

56
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:11,700
As soon as I snap you out of this little mean streak of yours, I'm gonna make you pay big for that!

57
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:13,700
You're not getting off the hook!

58
00:05:13,700 --> 00:05:16,700
Oh, it's Tomboy.

59
00:05:16,700 --> 00:05:18,700
What did you just call me?

60
00:05:18,700 --> 00:05:20,700
Why are you still here?

61
00:05:20,700 --> 00:05:22,700
What about the thing I gave you?

62
00:05:22,700 --> 00:05:24,700
I hid it in a safe place.

63
00:05:24,700 --> 00:05:25,700
Oh, that's real reassuring.

64
00:05:25,700 --> 00:05:27,700
You know I'm trusting you, right?

65
00:05:27,700 --> 00:05:29,700
Well, back at ya!

66
00:05:29,700 --> 00:05:31,700
I trusted you to save Char!

67
00:05:31,700 --> 00:05:33,700
Who do you think I am?

68
00:05:33,700 --> 00:05:35,700
I can't help her the way I am now.

69
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:37,700
Look, I trust you!

70
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:39,700
Wouldn't care if you didn't.

71
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:40,700
So?

72
00:05:40,700 --> 00:05:41,700
What's the next step?

73
00:05:41,700 --> 00:05:43,700
I'm trying to figure that out.

74
00:05:43,700 --> 00:05:44,700
Alright?

75
00:05:44,700 --> 00:05:45,700
I got it!

76
00:05:45,700 --> 00:05:48,700
You go take care of the townspeople!

77
00:05:48,700 --> 00:05:51,700
I'm sure there's more magic knights here.

78
00:05:51,700 --> 00:05:53,700
Find them and help everyone you can!

79
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:54,700
Right!

80
00:05:54,700 --> 00:05:55,700
As for my part...

81
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:57,700
Well...

82
00:05:57,700 --> 00:05:58,700
What happened here?

83
00:05:58,700 --> 00:06:03,700
I haven't a clue what the commotion is outside, but I am detecting a colossal amount of

84
00:06:03,700 --> 00:06:04,700
magic power.

85
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:09,700
Apparently enough to destroy the seal on this prison.

86
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:23,700
Whatever the cause may be, it looks like today's my lucky day.

87
00:06:23,700 --> 00:06:24,700
Now I'll finally be able to escape.

88
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:25,700
Hmm.

89
00:06:25,700 --> 00:06:26,700
Well, of all the degenerates I could have run into down here...

90
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:27,700
Hello, Captain Gelder.

91
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:28,700
I'm sorry.

92
00:06:28,700 --> 00:06:29,700
Ex-Captain.

93
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:30,700
Believe me, I'm just as surprised as you are.

94
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:31,700
I thought for certain I had seen the last of Chain Magic Rev Chiefs.

95
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:32,700
How long has it been?

96
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:34,700
Unfortunately, I'm in quite a hurry.

97
00:06:34,700 --> 00:06:37,700
So we'll have to reserve the last of Chain Magic Rev Chiefs.

98
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:38,700
I'm sure I'm in a hurry.

99
00:06:38,700 --> 00:06:40,700
I'll be able to save the last of Chain Magic Rev Chiefs.

100
00:06:40,700 --> 00:06:41,700
Whatever the cause may be, it looks like today's my lucky day.

101
00:06:41,700 --> 00:06:42,700
Now I'll finally be able to escape.

102
00:06:42,700 --> 00:06:43,700
Hmm.

103
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:45,700
Well, of all the degenerates I could have run into down here...

104
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:46,700
Hello, Captain Gelder.

105
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:47,700
I'm sorry.

106
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:48,700
Ex-Captain.

107
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:50,700
Believe me, I'm just as surprised as you are.

108
00:06:50,700 --> 00:06:53,700
I thought for certain I had seen the last of Chain Magic Rev Chiefs.

109
00:06:53,700 --> 00:06:56,700
How long has it been?

110
00:06:56,700 --> 00:06:59,700
Unfortunately, I'm in quite a hurry.

111
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:02,700
So we'll have to reserve the reminiscing for another time.

112
00:07:02,700 --> 00:07:07,700
That might be more convenient for you, but I'm afraid it simply isn't going to work for me.

113
00:07:07,700 --> 00:07:14,700
As you may recall, sir, two years ago, you sent me on the assignment that left me with this unsightly scar.

114
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:21,700
And after the mission resulted in failure, you placed the blame on me and my status as member of the Purple Orcus was permanently revoked.

115
00:07:21,700 --> 00:07:23,700
Oh, is that it?

116
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:25,700
It serves you right that you were banished.

117
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:28,700
I believe your squad mates weren't terribly fond of you anyway.

118
00:07:28,700 --> 00:07:32,700
Not a single one of them was willing to take your side if I remember correctly.

119
00:07:32,700 --> 00:07:34,700
Isn't that rich?

120
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:36,700
Seems like you aren't very popular either.

121
00:07:36,700 --> 00:07:42,700
Why else would the previous Captain of the Purple Orcas have been locked away to rot down here in this underground prison?

122
00:07:42,700 --> 00:07:52,700
You have no right to judge the behavior of a Captain seeing as how you were always perfectly content to let everyone around you move up in rank while you consistently dodged any mission that appeared to be even remotely dangerous.

123
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:56,700
You shouldn't accuse me of dodging when your transparency magic is nothing but dodging.

124
00:07:56,700 --> 00:08:02,700
It's far better than your cowardly chain magic, sealing the power of any mage you meet so that you don't have to fight.

125
00:08:02,700 --> 00:08:10,700
If it weren't for that infinite little upstart and his anti-magic abilities, there wouldn't be anyone in Clover Kingdom who could stand in my way!

126
00:08:10,700 --> 00:08:11,700
Huh?

127
00:08:15,700 --> 00:08:16,700
What, you two?

128
00:08:16,700 --> 00:08:18,700
It seems we feel the same.

129
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:30,700
His magic power is enormous!

130
00:08:30,700 --> 00:08:33,700
I can tell that without using my chains!

131
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:36,700
There are humans here as well.

132
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:39,700
Is he one of the people destroying the city?

133
00:08:40,700 --> 00:08:43,700
The Eye of the Midnight Sun is behind all this chaos?

134
00:08:43,700 --> 00:08:47,700
If so, it seems I may have gotten myself involved with a rather deadly organization.

135
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:51,700
We've been instructed to massacre any humans we see.

136
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:52,700
All of you!

137
00:08:52,700 --> 00:08:53,700
Wait!

138
00:08:53,700 --> 00:08:55,700
I assure you I am not your enemy!

139
00:08:55,700 --> 00:08:58,700
In fact, I may even be able to aid your endeavor!

140
00:08:58,700 --> 00:09:00,700
Please, let me speak with your leader!

141
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:05,700
We refuse to be fooled by you wicked humans again!

142
00:09:05,700 --> 00:09:06,700
You all die!

143
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:08,700
Everyone, no matter who you are!

144
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:12,700
Oh?

145
00:09:12,700 --> 00:09:13,700
We all die?

146
00:09:13,700 --> 00:09:16,700
I suppose we have no other choice then, Rep Chief.

147
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:18,700
It kills me to say this, but you're right.

148
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:21,700
If he's threatening our lives, there's only one thing to do.

149
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:23,700
Transparency magic!

150
00:09:23,700 --> 00:09:26,700
Invisible Seeker plus Invisible Traveling Companion!

151
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:29,700
They're gone!

152
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:32,700
And their magic power disappeared with them?

153
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:35,700
In that case, I'll tear apart this whole area!

154
00:09:43,700 --> 00:09:45,700
Chain Creation Magic!

155
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:47,700
Magic Finding Iron Chain Formation!

156
00:09:47,700 --> 00:09:50,700
Did he just seal away my magic power?

157
00:09:50,700 --> 00:09:51,700
Impossible!

158
00:09:51,700 --> 00:09:53,700
My strength is far superior to theirs!

159
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:55,700
What kind of techniques are those?

160
00:09:56,700 --> 00:09:59,700
Now that he's taken care of, we should be home free!

161
00:09:59,700 --> 00:10:03,700
Finally, these poor eyes of mine will see the light of day once more!

162
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:04,700
Indeed!

163
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:06,700
I knew it wasn't my fate to die in here!

164
00:10:06,700 --> 00:10:11,700
Rev G, let us make haste to clear our sullied names once and for all!

165
00:10:11,700 --> 00:10:12,700
Excellent idea!

166
00:10:12,700 --> 00:10:13,700
Good idea!

167
00:10:21,700 --> 00:10:22,700
You guys!

168
00:10:22,700 --> 00:10:23,700
What's wrong?

169
00:10:24,700 --> 00:10:26,700
It's just like with Veto and the others.

170
00:10:26,700 --> 00:10:28,700
It feels so evil!

171
00:10:28,700 --> 00:10:31,700
Why's that kind of magic power coming from you?

172
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:47,700
Why's that kind of magic power coming from you?

173
00:10:47,700 --> 00:10:48,700
Noelle's right.

174
00:10:48,700 --> 00:10:51,700
There's something terribly malicious at play here.

175
00:10:51,700 --> 00:10:54,700
Much like that House Vaud fellow.

176
00:10:54,700 --> 00:10:57,700
An ominous aura indeed.

177
00:10:57,700 --> 00:11:09,700
Finally, we've made it back.

178
00:11:09,700 --> 00:11:11,700
Let me kill them.

179
00:11:11,700 --> 00:11:12,700
Hmph.

180
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:15,700
You're energetic considering you've just awakened.

181
00:11:15,700 --> 00:11:18,700
Yeah, that's why I'm so pumped.

182
00:11:18,700 --> 00:11:20,700
Extra pumped actually.

183
00:11:20,700 --> 00:11:25,700
Oh dear.

184
00:11:25,700 --> 00:11:28,700
This thing is in the way.

185
00:11:32,700 --> 00:11:33,700
Luck?

186
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:34,700
I don't get it.

187
00:11:34,700 --> 00:11:35,700
What are you...

188
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:43,700
Uh, I was hoping they'd be a challenge, but they are human.

189
00:11:50,700 --> 00:11:55,700
I missed ya.

190
00:11:55,700 --> 00:11:57,700
Looks like I've gotten a little rusty.

191
00:11:59,700 --> 00:12:00,700
Let's try again.

192
00:12:00,700 --> 00:12:02,700
Cherry blossom magic!

193
00:12:02,700 --> 00:12:03,700
Raging magic!

194
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:04,700
Cherry blossom!

195
00:12:04,700 --> 00:12:05,700
Storm of petals!

196
00:12:06,700 --> 00:12:08,700
I don't know what caused this change in them.

197
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:11,700
But they certainly aren't the people they were before.

198
00:12:12,700 --> 00:12:15,700
You should prepare yourself to fight beautifully, Noelle.

199
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:16,700
But...

200
00:12:16,700 --> 00:12:17,700
It's Luck!

201
00:12:17,700 --> 00:12:18,700
He's a member of the Black Bulls!

202
00:12:18,700 --> 00:12:19,700
He's my friend!

203
00:12:19,700 --> 00:12:20,700
Noelle!

204
00:12:20,700 --> 00:12:21,700
Hmm...

205
00:12:21,700 --> 00:12:22,700
I can't see.

206
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:23,700
Which means there's no point in trying to aim.

207
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:24,700
That's okay.

208
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:25,700
Hmm...

209
00:12:25,700 --> 00:12:26,700
I'll try plan B.

210
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:27,700
His strength is growing!

211
00:12:27,700 --> 00:12:28,700
Use a defensive spell!

212
00:12:28,700 --> 00:12:29,700
Fly Luck!

213
00:12:29,700 --> 00:12:30,700
Stop this!

214
00:12:30,700 --> 00:12:31,700
We're friends!

215
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:32,700
Water creation magic!

216
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:33,700
See Dragon Slayer!

217
00:12:33,700 --> 00:12:43,700
Noelle-

218
00:12:43,700 --> 00:12:46,700
Noelle-

219
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:58,700
Noelle-

220
00:12:58,700 --> 00:12:59,700
No!

221
00:12:59,700 --> 00:13:02,220
No, even the essence of their powers changed.

222
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:05,480
Flux fighting on a totally different level now.

223
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:08,340
Your spells have a certain feel to them.

224
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,060
Let me guess, your royalty?

225
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:12,140
You don't...

226
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:13,540
What if we said yes?

227
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:16,220
Would you treat my lovely self differently then?

228
00:13:16,540 --> 00:13:17,400
I knew it.

229
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:19,620
This fight is getting better by the second.

230
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,980
Is this guy pulling my leg or what?

231
00:13:24,580 --> 00:13:26,360
He was overpowered from the beginning.

232
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:29,180
But now it feels like he's about to blow the roof off.

233
00:13:29,700 --> 00:13:34,580
Like I said, deception is kind of my thing.

234
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:40,020
And since I'm a liar, I can tell when other people are lying too.

235
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:43,280
Look, Mr. Anti-Magic.

236
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:46,260
What you said a little while ago?

237
00:13:47,060 --> 00:13:51,460
I just want a kingdom where all of us get along and laugh together.

238
00:13:51,860 --> 00:13:53,980
And when I'm the Wizard King, we'll have one.

239
00:13:54,420 --> 00:13:55,040
You'll see.

240
00:13:56,060 --> 00:13:58,380
I know you meant every word.

241
00:13:58,380 --> 00:13:59,660
Too bad, really.

242
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:02,600
For a split second, I was actually moved.

243
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:06,740
Just like the last time.

244
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,780
Let's foster understanding.

245
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:12,220
There were no lies in anything that he said.

246
00:14:12,780 --> 00:14:14,100
And so I trusted him.

247
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:16,400
And what did it get me?

248
00:14:17,940 --> 00:14:18,420
That.

249
00:14:18,420 --> 00:14:23,400
So you see, I'm done with trusting.

250
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:28,360
And to make sure you know I mean it, I'll kill you.

251
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:32,460
Copy Light Magic.

252
00:14:32,460 --> 00:14:34,080
Light Swords of Conviction.

253
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,280
Copy Dark Magic.

254
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:36,400
Lightless Slash.

255
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:39,760
Two different techniques at the same time?

256
00:14:40,260 --> 00:14:41,420
Mono Zone.

257
00:14:42,020 --> 00:14:43,380
Collidos Brachium.

258
00:14:43,540 --> 00:14:44,420
Bronsbound.

259
00:14:44,420 --> 00:14:57,860
Do you see what I'm saying now?

260
00:14:58,280 --> 00:15:01,820
To them, there is no getting along, no matter how badly you want it.

261
00:15:01,820 --> 00:15:08,000
They're determined to kill every one of us and wipe out all of Clover Kingdom.

262
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:09,600
Maybe they are.

263
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,380
But I'll still win!

264
00:15:11,640 --> 00:15:13,680
And I'll make a way for us to get along!

265
00:15:13,900 --> 00:15:16,600
The road to mutual understandings closed, pal.

266
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:17,400
I don't care.

267
00:15:17,580 --> 00:15:18,780
I'll open it back up.

268
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:20,920
Fine, fine.

269
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:21,840
You can try.

270
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:23,900
But you'd better make it quick.

271
00:15:24,700 --> 00:15:26,640
Otherwise, I'll kill him myself.

272
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:27,600
Right.

273
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:30,280
Now, Collidos Brachium!

274
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:36,200
If she manages to hit me with that move of hers,

275
00:15:36,300 --> 00:15:38,960
there's no way I'm going to make it out of this place with my life.

276
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:41,540
I better be on my toes.

277
00:15:43,420 --> 00:15:46,160
A combination of spatial and light magic.

278
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:50,060
He's using my light spell to make himself more agile.

279
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:56,100
Volte's spatial magic is the perfect thing to keep her from hitting me with that attack.

280
00:15:56,100 --> 00:15:58,820
It's sad the old codger's not around anymore,

281
00:15:58,940 --> 00:16:00,580
but at least I got something good out of him.

282
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:03,480
Copy spatial magic myriad black!

283
00:16:03,740 --> 00:16:05,920
Copy light magic sky-rending flash!

284
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:07,420
You can't toss forever!

285
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:17,140
Seriously, this jerk is untouchable!

286
00:16:17,140 --> 00:16:27,100
Will?

287
00:16:27,100 --> 00:16:28,160
Is that you?

288
00:16:28,700 --> 00:16:29,660
Hey, Raya!

289
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:30,800
Good to see you!

290
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:32,800
I'm so happy that you're awake!

291
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:38,680
Hey, Lyra.

292
00:16:39,060 --> 00:16:41,500
You're just as hyperactive as I remember.

293
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:43,540
Why wouldn't I be?

294
00:16:43,980 --> 00:16:47,320
And you've still got that goofy, spaced-out look on your face.

295
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:48,360
Can it, kid?

296
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:52,980
Oh, Raya!

297
00:16:53,220 --> 00:16:54,840
I missed you so much!

298
00:16:56,180 --> 00:16:58,480
Did you stop being a little pain already?

299
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:00,480
I'm just really happy!

300
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:03,360
Well, go be happy over there.

301
00:17:03,540 --> 00:17:03,880
Hey!

302
00:17:04,380 --> 00:17:04,780
Will!

303
00:17:05,020 --> 00:17:06,460
Why are you hugging that monster?

304
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:08,580
You know what?

305
00:17:08,820 --> 00:17:10,860
My ability has a fancy name now.

306
00:17:11,120 --> 00:17:11,880
Picture magic!

307
00:17:12,560 --> 00:17:13,040
Nice.

308
00:17:13,620 --> 00:17:16,040
You do know he's trying to murder us all, right?

309
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,020
Or did you forget?

310
00:17:17,940 --> 00:17:18,840
Say what?

311
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:20,260
I'm confused.

312
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:21,200
You are?

313
00:17:21,340 --> 00:17:22,740
We were in the middle of a fight,

314
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:23,840
and suddenly you bust in,

315
00:17:23,860 --> 00:17:25,280
and you guys are all buddy-buddy?

316
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:28,020
Do I know you?

317
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:30,340
What the...

318
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:30,680
Rill?

319
00:17:31,120 --> 00:17:31,960
Who's Rill?

320
00:17:32,580 --> 00:17:33,400
Didn't you hear?

321
00:17:33,540 --> 00:17:34,480
My name's Lyra.

322
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:35,440
Huh?

323
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:37,060
What's going on?

324
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:39,320
The captain of the Aqua Deer.

325
00:17:39,860 --> 00:17:42,520
His magic power's gone from crazy to ludicrous.

326
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:45,220
Just like Mr. Copycat over there.

327
00:17:46,100 --> 00:17:48,640
That spatial mage from the Golden Dawn

328
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:50,540
has felt the same way.

329
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:52,160
Was that an omen?

330
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:53,740
Whatever this is,

331
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:55,460
it must have boosted their strength.

332
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,700
I can tell from the change in their auras

333
00:17:57,700 --> 00:17:59,180
that it's not brainwashing.

334
00:17:59,700 --> 00:18:02,220
That little one doesn't recognize the rookie at all anymore.

335
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:04,540
Are they being possessed by other people?

336
00:18:04,540 --> 00:18:06,420
It's me, your old friend, Asta.

337
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:08,380
You and I are both magic knights, remember?

338
00:18:08,660 --> 00:18:11,620
How could you possibly forget about a big loud mouth like me?

339
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:15,820
Yeah, you're loud and super annoying.

340
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:19,940
And there's no way I would ever have a human as a friend.

341
00:18:19,940 --> 00:18:23,320
I know how to shut you up.

342
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:25,520
Check out this picture magic technique.

343
00:18:25,860 --> 00:18:27,180
Four-headed lindworm.

344
00:18:27,180 --> 00:18:36,800
You're no match for me!

345
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:44,780
He's obviously being controlled by some enemy spell.

346
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:47,680
You should try smacking him with your anti-magic sword.

347
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:48,320
Right!

348
00:18:48,540 --> 00:18:49,220
I'm on it!

349
00:18:49,220 --> 00:18:50,300
Sorry, guys.

350
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:52,400
You can throw whatever you want at us,

351
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:54,020
but it's never gonna reach us now.

352
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:55,980
We'll see about that.

353
00:18:56,700 --> 00:18:58,020
You think I've been standing here

354
00:18:58,020 --> 00:18:59,720
twiddling my thumbs this whole time?

355
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:02,840
Ash-trap magic!

356
00:19:03,300 --> 00:19:03,900
Activate!

357
00:19:03,900 --> 00:19:05,360
Oh, I see.

358
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:07,840
You were setting something up for us, too, huh?

359
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:08,900
Big deal.

360
00:19:08,980 --> 00:19:11,540
A paralyzing trap isn't gonna help you much.

361
00:19:11,780 --> 00:19:13,120
I can't see.

362
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:15,780
But we're good at picking up on other people's powers,

363
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:18,620
so I'm sure we can still wipe the floor with you guys either way!

364
00:19:18,980 --> 00:19:20,540
Let's see if you feel that way

365
00:19:20,540 --> 00:19:22,160
after this one gets through with you.

366
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:24,280
He's a magicless monster.

367
00:19:24,280 --> 00:19:31,480
He's got anti-magic coursing through his whole body.

368
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:32,500
Hey, where are you?

369
00:19:32,780 --> 00:19:34,540
Now step out of it, Will!

370
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:40,800
Graved him.

371
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:44,800
It's not much, but it should be enough to break the...

372
00:19:44,800 --> 00:19:49,420
That hurt me, you know.

373
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:51,120
What's your problem?

374
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,660
It's no good.

375
00:19:52,660 --> 00:19:55,760
Man, I thought for sure that would work.

376
00:19:56,560 --> 00:19:59,180
Sorry, but thanks to reincarnation magic,

377
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:01,640
we elves have been awakened in these human forms.

378
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:04,560
Isn't that something?

379
00:20:05,260 --> 00:20:06,800
Whether you understand it or not,

380
00:20:06,860 --> 00:20:08,780
the soul-transferring process is complete,

381
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:11,320
which means that these bodies belong to us now.

382
00:20:12,300 --> 00:20:12,860
Reincarnation?

383
00:20:13,780 --> 00:20:14,340
Elves?

384
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:16,080
Quit messing around!

385
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:17,100
Spring real back!

386
00:20:22,660 --> 00:20:23,700
All of them, too?

387
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:25,060
This is bad.

388
00:20:25,760 --> 00:20:28,060
Every one of them's given off crazy amounts of power.

389
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:30,580
We won't last five minutes against them.

390
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:34,140
Time to go.

391
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:34,900
Come on.

392
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:36,280
Do you want to run?

393
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:36,680
Really?

394
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:38,240
We can't just leave them.

395
00:20:38,520 --> 00:20:39,140
No way!

396
00:20:39,500 --> 00:20:40,260
Not yet!

397
00:20:40,820 --> 00:20:41,260
Moron.

398
00:20:41,260 --> 00:20:43,980
There's nothing we can do to save them right now.

399
00:20:44,320 --> 00:20:48,040
That's why we should retreat and come up with a plan, birdbrained shorty.

400
00:20:48,900 --> 00:20:50,500
Yeah, you're right.

401
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:52,440
You and your dumb cool mask.

402
00:20:52,820 --> 00:20:53,880
What's the alternative?

403
00:20:54,580 --> 00:20:55,420
I know you.

404
00:20:55,900 --> 00:20:57,760
And you can't kill your buddies.

405
00:20:58,720 --> 00:20:59,660
Neither can you.

406
00:20:59,660 --> 00:21:01,880
But you can't get away, either.

407
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:04,040
So you two wimps are out of options.

408
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:07,720
This is pitiful.

409
00:21:18,300 --> 00:21:21,540
Run along home now, children.

410
00:21:22,460 --> 00:21:23,240
But, Captain!

411
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:23,600
Captain!

412
00:21:29,660 --> 00:21:35,580
Ah, so you want to stay here and slow us down so they can run back with their tails between their legs.

413
00:21:35,860 --> 00:21:38,400
You seem like a benevolent leader, Madam Royal.

414
00:21:43,620 --> 00:21:44,140
Fool.

415
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:46,860
You don't understand a thing, do you?

416
00:21:47,360 --> 00:21:47,580
Hmm?

417
00:21:47,940 --> 00:21:51,200
I sent those novices home because they were getting in my way.

418
00:21:51,720 --> 00:21:52,740
Slow you down.

419
00:21:53,100 --> 00:21:54,420
Don't make me laugh.

420
00:21:54,420 --> 00:21:57,900
I wanted the chance to obliterate all of you personally!

421
00:21:59,660 --> 00:22:01,540
Listen to me.

422
00:22:02,560 --> 00:22:26,500
I'm not

423
00:22:29,660 --> 00:22:42,340
I don't need no money, I don't need no魔力は要らない

424
00:22:42,340 --> 00:22:45,300
自力で挑んでミラクル起きること願い

425
00:22:45,300 --> 00:22:48,420
魅力ながら1mmずつビリビリ切り込んでく

426
00:22:48,420 --> 00:22:50,020
世界を巻き込んでく

427
00:22:50,020 --> 00:22:52,100
My disability is my ability

428
00:22:52,100 --> 00:22:54,520
逆にそれが俺のエネルギー

429
00:22:54,520 --> 00:23:02,760
どうしても自らを見失って嫌いになって

430
00:23:02,760 --> 00:23:06,840
負けそうになったら

431
00:23:06,840 --> 00:23:10,000
Just cry out loud

432
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:13,520
傷つく音に 傷つく音に

433
00:23:13,520 --> 00:23:16,940
立ち向かう勇気へと導いてく

434
00:23:16,940 --> 00:23:17,700
Our treasure

435
00:23:17,700 --> 00:23:21,680
裏切らないのは最高にThere is love

436
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:26,680
Kazashita chinkai hikari ga nikiru treasure

